# Keep line endings LF in the working tree, not just in the repo.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites files to CRLF on checkout, and
# prettier (endOfLine: "lf", the default) then fails format:check on files nobody edited.
# That happened: a single `git checkout -- package.json` was enough to break `pnpm verify`
# locally while CI, which checks out on Linux, stayed green.
#
# No tracked file in this repo is binary, so text=auto is unambiguous here.
* text=auto eol=lf
